# Tribunal "Sotha Sil": with the blade reforged, Almalexia, asked through
# "unstable", "Clockwork City", "his madness" and "man he once was", says Sotha
# Sil must be stopped (10) and, told "I am prepared to go." (1), sends the player to the
# Clockwork City (20, SothaSilTeleport to the Outer Flooded Halls). In the Dome
# of Sotha Sil his body hangs from a machine; activated, it logs 50
# (Sotha_SothaSil). Almalexia appears when the player comes within 240, speaks
# four lines with the player's controls off, then fights (70, Sotha_Alma); her
# death logs 100. Azura's spirit in the Temple Courtyard then appears and speaks
# (110, TribEnd), and Helseth, told of the attacks, gives his guard's armor
# (TR_Champion 110).
# The player walks from the Outer Flooded Halls to the Dome with PositionCell,
# and the damage stands in for the fight. Ref FormIDs carry Tribunal.esm's
# slot 06.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tr_blade --timeout 2400
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tr_sotha_sil
run
player->PositionCell 1 49 -659 0 "Mournhold Temple: High Chapel"
until 600 "almalexia"->GetDistance player < 400
talk almalexia
ask unstable
ask Clockwork City
ask his madness
ask man he once was
ask must be stopped
expect GetJournalIndex TR_SothaSil == 10
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TR_SothaSil == 20
bye
until 600 GetPCCell "Sotha Sil, Outer Flooded Halls" == 1
run
player->PositionCell 4032 3900 12300 0 "Sotha Sil, Dome of Sotha Sil"
until 300 GetPCCell "Sotha Sil, Dome of Sotha Sil" == 1
wait 300
activate 06833643
button 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex TR_SothaSil == 50
player->PositionCell 4048 3500 12300 0 "Sotha Sil, Dome of Sotha Sil"
until 2400 GetJournalIndex TR_SothaSil == 70
console 0629B3A3.damageav health 10000
until 600 GetJournalIndex TR_SothaSil == 100
run
player->PositionCell 8 -1750 431 0 "Mournhold, Temple Courtyard"
until 300 GetPCCell "Mournhold, Temple Courtyard" == 1
until 2400 GetJournalIndex TR_SothaSil == 110
run
player->PositionCell 2 53 -92 0 "Mournhold, Royal Palace Throne Room"
until 300 GetPCCell "Mournhold, Royal Palace Throne Room" == 1
wait 300
set TestResult to ( "King Hlaalu Helseth"->GetPos x )
player->SetPos x TestResult
set TestResult to ( "King Hlaalu Helseth"->GetPos y )
set TestResult to ( TestResult + 100 )
player->SetPos y TestResult
until 600 "King Hlaalu Helseth"->GetDistance player < 400
talk King Hlaalu Helseth
ask learn more about the attacks
expect GetJournalIndex TR_Champion == 110
expect player->GetItemCount "Helsethguard_cuirass" == 1
bye
end
